This project is a substantially modified continuation of JByteMod and
JByteMod Reborn:

  https://github.com/loerting/JByteMod-Beta
  https://github.com/DotRacel/JByteMod-Reborn

The Remastered project changes the original program and includes, among
other work, newer Java and bytecode support, additional decompilers,
archive and APK handling, runtime JVM attachment, a modular agent and
plugin API, bytecode analysis and editing improvements, and a plugin
repository. Modification dates and authorship are recorded in the Git
history and release changelogs.

